					<div class="stl_01" style="left:7.5em;top:7.1897em;"><span class="stl_05" style="word-spacing:0em;">including the following minimum responsibilities: &nbsp;</span></div>
					<div class="stl_01" style="left:8.5em;top:8.3397em;"><span class="stl_05" style="word-spacing:0.25em;">(a) Developing,</span><span class="stl_05" style="word-spacing:0em;">&nbsp;</span><span class="stl_05 stl_08" style="word-spacing:0.09em;">implementing, and evaluating program and center policies. &nbsp;</span></div>
					<div class="stl_01" style="left:8.5em;top:9.4889em;"><span class="stl_05" style="word-spacing:0em;">(b) Administering day-to-day operations, including being available to address parent, &nbsp;</span></div>
