					<div class="stl_01" style="left:8.5em;top:11.7897em;"><span class="stl_05" style="word-spacing:0.25em;">(c) Monitoring</span><span class="stl_05" style="word-spacing:0em;">&nbsp;</span><span class="stl_05 stl_06" style="word-spacing:0em;">staff, including an annual evaluations<span class="stl_07">. &nbsp;</span></span></div>
					<div class="stl_01" style="left:8em;top:12.9397em;"><span class="stl_05 stl_08" style="word-spacing:0.29em;">(4) If</span><span class="stl_05" style="word-spacing:0.01em;">&nbsp;</span><span class="stl_05" style="word-spacing:0em;">absent from the center, the program director shall designate a child care staff member &nbsp;</span></div>
