					<div class="stl_01" style="left:7.97em;top:31.6689em;"><span class="stl_05 stl_08" style="word-spacing:1.16em;">(g) High</span><span class="stl_05" style="word-spacing:0em;">&nbsp;</span><span class="stl_05" style="word-spacing:0em;">school diploma or &nbsp;</span></div>
