					<div class="stl_01" style="left:8em;top:38.2389em;"><span class="stl_05" style="word-spacing:0.25em;">(11) For</span><span class="stl_05" style="word-spacing:0em;">&nbsp;</span><span class="stl_05 stl_08" style="word-spacing:0.06em;">the conversion of an existing building, exterior exit doors shall be not less than 36 &nbsp;</span></div>
