					<div class="stl_01" style="left:7.5em;top:46.2897em;"><span class="stl_05 stl_06" style="word-spacing:0em;">be distinctive in color and provide contrast with decorations, interior finish, or other signs<span class="stl_07">. &nbsp;</span></span></div>
					<div class="stl_01" style="left:7.5em;top:47.4397em;"><span class="stl_05 stl_08" style="word-spacing:0.06em;">Each exit sign shall have the word “EXIT” in plain, legible letters not less than 6 inches high, &nbsp;</span></div>
					<div class="stl_01" style="left:7.5em;top:48.5897em;"><span class="stl_05 stl_08" style="word-spacing:0.06em;">on a background of contrasting color, with strokes not less than ¾-inch wide.</span><span class="stl_05" style="word-spacing:0.25em;">&nbsp;</span><span class="stl_05 stl_08" style="word-spacing:0.06em;">The word &nbsp;</span></div>
					<div class="stl_01" style="left:7.5em;top:49.7389em;"><span class="stl_05 stl_08" style="word-spacing:0.06em;">“EXIT” shall have letters that are not less than 2 inches wide, except the letter “I”. &nbsp;</span></div>
					<div class="stl_01" style="left:8em;top:50.8889em;"><span class="stl_05 stl_08" style="word-spacing:0.33em;">(14) Exit</span><span class="stl_05" style="word-spacing:0em;">&nbsp;</span><span class="stl_05" style="word-spacing:0em;">signs shall be internally or externally illuminated at all times.</span><span class="stl_05" style="word-spacing:0.25em;">&nbsp;</span><span class="stl_05 stl_08" style="word-spacing:0.08em;">To ensure &nbsp;</span></div>
					<div class="stl_01" style="left:7.5em;top:52.0397em;"><span class="stl_05" style="word-spacing:0em;">continued illumination for a duration of not less than 90 minutes, in case of primary power &nbsp;</span></div>
